        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Gemini &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>Defteros's black flame &mdash; the volcanic eruption of the shadow twin.</em></p><p>Each creature in the area takes @Damage[8d8[fire]] damage with a basic Reflex save. A creature that critically fails is <strong>blinded for 1 minute</strong>: Mavros burns black, and what it takes first is sight.</p><p>The area burns for 1 minute. A creature that enters it or ends its turn there takes @Damage[4d6[persistent,fire]] damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The initial damage increases by 1d8 and the persistent fire damage by 1d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
        },
